// client { action:'manual', petId } creates an on-demand report; { action:'quota', petId }.
// The `reports` collection is server-written only (security rule write:false), so every client
// change to a report goes through here, owner-checked:
//   { action:'read',  reportId } → read:true (never touches updatedAt — the worker's claim lock uses it)
//   { action:'retry', reportId } → back to pending, bounded by MAX_CLIENT_ATTEMPTS (attempts never reset)
//   { action:'purge', petId }    → delete the caller's reports of a pet that no longer exists
